'''Pikachu ex''' (Japanese: '''ピカチュウex''' ''Pikachu ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

